            "description": {
              "value": "You're well-versed in weapons that allow you to bring bounties in alive. You are trained with the following weapons: bola, sap, and whip. You gain access to bolas. Whenever you gain a class feature that grants you expert or greater proficiency in a given weapon or weapons, you also gain that proficiency in the weapons listed.\n\nIn addition, you take no penalty when making a nonlethal attack with a weapon without the nonlethal trait."
